Title: Security Rules
Status: CANONICAL

- LAN-only deployment; no inbound WAN. (ADR-0017)
- Secrets via `SecretVaultPort` and `SecretRef`; no secrets in logs/LLM context. (ADR-0019, R43)
- Data classification and sinks deny-by-default; SECRET only via SecretVault IPC. (R46)
- No real financial/secret data in Git/CI/Slack/Linear/Figma.

